'''Ancient Egg: N103''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Catnip Challenges]] after completing 15 [[Behemoth Culling]] stages for the first time. It was added in [[Version 11.6 Update|Version 11.6]]. [[True Form]] massively increases overall stats, increases cost and recharge time, and gains Behemoth Slayer and [[Immune to Toxic|Toxic Immunity]].

