**The "Dark Egg" name is also used by [[Ancient Egg: N201 (Special Cat)|Dark Egg: N201]] and [[Ancient Egg: N109 (Rare Cat)|Dark Egg: N109]], who both target [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] and not [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]].
*Gas Mask Cat could be a reference to [[wikipedia:Akira Toriyama|Akira Toriyama]], who draws himself wearing a Gas Mask.

